  "body": "As part of the [work](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/13963) to speed up DM creation, some of the initial room creation events have been batched up (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/13800) for bulk sending/persisting. Investigate whether the [membership event](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/6f0c3e669da458e838e7b4b165a13e8a5312d6d0/synapse/handlers/room.py#L1144) can be added to this batch, and if so, do it. ",
